{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ls1SBusewe5Ef6FX16Fejb","type":"tool_result","content":"2703:### interface ParticlePreset\n2704-\n2705-A particle effect as data. Sizes are in art pixels (whole pixels, so particles stay crisp\n2706-squares), colors are palette names stepped over each particle's life (no blending).\n2707-\n2708-- `count: Range`: Particles per burst.\n2709-- `life: Range`: Seconds each particle lives.\n2710-- `speed: Range`: Launch speed, world units / s.\n2711-- `direction?: Vec3`: Main launch direction (default straight up).\n2712-- `spread?: number`: Cone half-angle around `direction`, degrees (180 = every direction). Default 180.\n2713-- `flatten?: number`: Multiply vertical launch speed (0.2 = dust that hugs the ground). Default 1.\n2714-- `gravity?: number`: Downward acceleration, world units / s² (negative floats up). Default 0.\n2715-- `drag?: number`: Velocity damping per second (0 = none).\n2716-- `size: readonly [number, number]`: Size in art pixels at birth and at death (rounded to whole pixels).\n2717-- `colors: readonly PaletteColor[]`: Palette colors stepped through over the lifetime.\n2718-- `radius?: number`: Random spawn offset radius, world units.\n2719-- `max?: number`: Pool size (max alive at once). Default 256.\n2720-\n2721-### type ParticlePresetName\n2722-\n2723-```ts\n3911:### applySky()\n3912-\n3913-```ts\n3914-function applySky(engine: Pick<Engine, 'sun' | 'ambient' | 'scene' | 'setSunDirection'>, s: SkyState): void\n3915-```\n3916-\n3917-Put a sky on the engine: sun direction, colour and strength, ambient light, background.\n--\n4733:### skyAt()\n4734-\n4735-```ts\n4736-function skyAt(hour: number): SkyState\n4737-```\n4738-\n4739-The sky at `hour` (wraps around 24).","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83ee8bb7-9f1f-4db7-994e-0a6a2ece78a9","uuid":"4e5642bd-1e22-48f2-811d-dcbaaaa24376","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:30:10.669Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"2703:### interface ParticlePreset\n2704-\n2705-A particle effect as data. Sizes are in art pixels (whole pixels, so particles stay crisp\n2706-squares), colors are palette names stepped over each particle's life (no blending).\n2707-\n2708-- `count: Range`: Particles per burst.\n2709-- `life: Range`: Seconds each particle lives.\n2710-- `speed: Range`: Launch speed, world units / s.\n2711-- `direction?: Vec3`: Main launch direction (default straight up).\n2712-- `spread?: number`: Cone half-angle around `direction`, degrees (180 = every direction). Default 180.\n2713-- `flatten?: number`: Multiply vertical launch speed (0.2 = dust that hugs the ground). Default 1.\n2714-- `gravity?: number`: Downward acceleration, world units / s² (negative floats up). Default 0.\n2715-- `drag?: number`: Velocity damping per second (0 = none).\n2716-- `size: readonly [number, number]`: Size in art pixels at birth and at death (rounded to whole pixels).\n2717-- `colors: readonly PaletteColor[]`: Palette colors stepped through over the lifetime.\n2718-- `radius?: number`: Random spawn offset radius, world units.\n2719-- `max?: number`: Pool size (max alive at once). Default 256.\n2720-\n2721-### type ParticlePresetName\n2722-\n2723-```ts\n3911:### applySky()\n3912-\n3913-```ts\n3914-function applySky(engine: Pick<Engine, 'sun' | 'ambient' | 'scene' | 'setSunDirection'>, s: SkyState): void\n3915-```\n3916-\n3917-Put a sky on the engine: sun direction, colour and strength, ambient light, background.\n--\n4733:### skyAt()\n4734-\n4735-```ts\n4736-function skyAt(hour: number): SkyState\n4737-```\n4738-\n4739-The sky at `hour` (wraps around 24).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Ls1SBusewe5Ef6FX16Fejb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
