{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014hmYxZngb2QpQLnZzJgsSZ","type":"tool_result","content":"# Credits (Pixel Engine 0.46.0)\n\nWhat this kit carries and where it came from, generated by `npm run bundle` from each built-in model's and texture's `source` (the data the engine repository's `npm run model -- credits` reads) and from the bundled packa\n\n## Models and textures\n\n- **The engine's own work**, made in its repository: 151 of the 151 library models (`MODEL_LIBRARY`), 126 of the 126 textures (`TEXTURE_LIBRARY`) and the built-in models (`assets/coin.glb`, `assets/hero.glb`, `assets/tre\n- **kenney-castle** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/castle-kit/a395102d20-1711543616/kenney_castle-kit.zip. Models: kenney-\n- **kenney-furniture** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/furniture-kit/440e0608a4-1677580847/kenney_furniture-kit.zip. Models\n- **kenney-mini-dungeon** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/mini-dungeon/6cd72dc849-1785314274/kenney_mini-dungeon.zip. Model\n- **kenney-nature** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/nature-kit/37ac38a37b-1677698939/kenney_nature-kit.zip. Models: kenney-\n- **kenney-tiny-dungeon** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/tiny-dungeon/f8422efb44-1674742415/kenney_tiny-dungeon.zip. Textu\n- **kenney-tiny-town** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/tiny-town/a415fbeb49-1735736916/kenney_tiny-town.zip. Textures: kenn\n- **Your own imports** carry a `source` too (url, licence, author): credit them as their licence asks. A pack loaded with `loadPack` carries its models' and textures' `source`s.\n\n## Palettes\n\n- **Sweetie 16** by GrafxKid: the engine's 16 colours (`PALETTE`) and the `sweetie16` filter.\n- **PICO-8** by Lexaloffle Games (the PICO-8 fantasy console): the `pico8` filter.\n\n## Code\n\n- **three.js (three)** 0.186.0, MIT: https://threejs.org/. Its licence follows.\n- **Rapier (@dimforge/rapier3d)** 0.20.0, Apache-2.0: https://rapier.rs. Its licence follows.\n\n### three.js (three) licence\n\n```text\nThe MIT License\n\nCopyright © 2010-2026 three.js authors\n\nPermission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\nof this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\nin the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\nto use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\ncopies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\nfurnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\nThe above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83ee8bb7-9f1f-4db7-994e-0a6a2ece78a9","uuid":"34a241f0-2953-44f4-a45f-d80d40042dbf","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:42:35.233Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Credits (Pixel Engine 0.46.0)\n\nWhat this kit carries and where it came from, generated by `npm run bundle` from each built-in model's and texture's `source` (the data the engine repository's `npm run model -- credits` reads) and from the bundled packa\n\n## Models and textures\n\n- **The engine's own work**, made in its repository: 151 of the 151 library models (`MODEL_LIBRARY`), 126 of the 126 textures (`TEXTURE_LIBRARY`) and the built-in models (`assets/coin.glb`, `assets/hero.glb`, `assets/tre\n- **kenney-castle** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/castle-kit/a395102d20-1711543616/kenney_castle-kit.zip. Models: kenney-\n- **kenney-furniture** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/furniture-kit/440e0608a4-1677580847/kenney_furniture-kit.zip. Models\n- **kenney-mini-dungeon** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/mini-dungeon/6cd72dc849-1785314274/kenney_mini-dungeon.zip. Model\n- **kenney-nature** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/nature-kit/37ac38a37b-1677698939/kenney_nature-kit.zip. Models: kenney-\n- **kenney-tiny-dungeon** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/tiny-dungeon/f8422efb44-1674742415/kenney_tiny-dungeon.zip. Textu\n- **kenney-tiny-town** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/tiny-town/a415fbeb49-1735736916/kenney_tiny-town.zip. Textures: kenn\n- **Your own imports** carry a `source` too (url, licence, author): credit them as their licence asks. A pack loaded with `loadPack` carries its models' and textures' `source`s.\n\n## Palettes\n\n- **Sweetie 16** by GrafxKid: the engine's 16 colours (`PALETTE`) and the `sweetie16` filter.\n- **PICO-8** by Lexaloffle Games (the PICO-8 fantasy console): the `pico8` filter.\n\n## Code\n\n- **three.js (three)** 0.186.0, MIT: https://threejs.org/. Its licence follows.\n- **Rapier (@dimforge/rapier3d)** 0.20.0, Apache-2.0: https://rapier.rs. Its licence follows.\n\n### three.js (three) licence\n\n```text\nThe MIT License\n\nCopyright © 2010-2026 three.js authors\n\nPermission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\nof this software and associated documentation 