{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkyTHTTMdPM1BXqscnuB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 469-check suite passes after the latest changes, and I rebuilt the final HTML in `work/` afterwards. It boots from `file://` with no errors, and `exit-interview.json` is beside it.\n\n- **Marshals in a hub round:** I ran a hub-flagged race outside the harness and confirmed all 6 marshals and the start gantry were created. I put the camera next to one and looked at it at 1080p: a marshal stands behind the Kestrel barrier.\n- **Hub round in the real harness:** I did not re-check marshals there. The harness run earlier only confirmed the protocol and showed the gantry and a trackside stand.\n- **Map at night:** I raised the ambient light again. The sea is still dark blue, which is right for night. The buildings and the neon and lamp markers on the arcade, theatre and dealer are visible, and I looked at the shot.\n- **Hub flakiness:** a 4-player harness run failed once more during the final suite, which pointed back at load timing. I pushed the hub-round props to about 8 seconds after `ready()` and the marshals to about 10 seconds, so they don't compete with other copies still starting up. The harness then passed 12 of 12 runs, and the final full forced suite passed.\n\nI have not looked at every item on the plan's 1080p review list, only the ones covered across these turns."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":448,"cache_read_input_tokens":698310,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":448},"output_tokens":439,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83ee8bb7-9f1f-4db7-994e-0a6a2ece78a9","uuid":"563bcb4a-b118-4a37-b989-4954727e377