{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says. Done when: Everything in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer is done, and everything TASK.md asks you to hand in is in this folder.]: Not satisfied on transcript evidence. The final message admits the marshal hub check reads 3 of 6 marshals and that the threshold was loosened from 5 to 1 to pass. The Handbook page change was not re-shot after the edit. The Saltline start shot shows a heavy grandstand slab close to the camera, and that was not addressed. The plan's section 16 requires the 1080p checklist to be viewed, and the latest state of the suite and of the Handbook and Saltline items was not shown after the final edits."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83ee8bb7-9f1f-4db7-994e-0a6a2ece78a9","uuid":"6bcaa0c4-14ca-402b-9939-a6943271e77b","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:46:07.285Z","isSynthetic":true}
