{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm1ZYnrGjLf6qQzb5G9y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fixed everything on your list. The full forced suite passes (470 checks) after the last edit, and the HTML in `work/` was rebuilt from that state. It boots from `file://` with no errors, and `exit-interview.json` is beside it.\n\n- **Marshals in a real hub round:** all 6 now appear, and the hub suite requires 6 rather than the earlier threshold of 1. The earlier reading of 3 came from Saltline having only three corners, since I placed one marshal per corner. Marshals now load together and are spaced along the track, and the suite samples the count during the round. The hub suite passed three runs in a row, then the full forced suite.\n- **Saltline start:** I moved the grandstand back from the track. I re-shot the start at 1080p and looked at it: the slab no longer fills the view and the sky is open.\n- **Handbook:** I re-shot the pit-stop page after adding the panel behind its text. It reads cleanly at 1080p.\n\nThe marshal timing is still sensitive to machine load. One run read 0 because the round ended before they loaded. I moved their load earlier (about 5 seconds after ready) and polled for the count during the round. I have not seen a failure since, but that is a handful of runs."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":455,"cache_read_input_tokens":718297,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":455},"output_tokens":400,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83ee8bb7-9f1f-4db7-994e-0a6a2ece78a9","uuid":"b14cfe7b-1100-4d32-bf0d-67ead0c32537","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:03:26.817Z","request_id":"req_011Cgm1ZXfdj5qFGvWRsni7N"}
