{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm22hroYfLQ57ALfuMHu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything the stage asked for is done and nothing needs further work. Every item on the plan's section 16 1080p list has been viewed, and I have not changed any code since the last full green run.\n\n**Section 16 checklist, each item with the shot I looked at**\n\n| Item | What I viewed |\n|---|---|\n| Each car in the showroom | All 14: Kite, Longhorn, Heck, Type 9, Moth and Libeccio from the side; Pico, Ginga, Ryu, Brandt 3.2, Kite Cup, Ryu Rally, Works GT and Corsa from behind |\n| Each track at the start | All six: Proving Ground, Kestrel, Cedar, Harbour, Saltline, Red Clay |\n| Each track at a corner | Kestrel and Cedar with the car AI-driven on the road; Saltline, Harbour and Red Clay from earlier shots, where the car had been teleported onto the racing line (the Kestrel and Cedar shots that had landed on grass were redone) |\n| Map at day and night | Both viewed; the night map was re-shot after the lighting change |\n| Race HUD | Viewed on several tracks |\n| Results screen | Viewed |\n| Settings | Viewed |\n| Handbook page | Pit-stop page re-shot after the panel fix |\n| Tuning | Viewed |\n| Harbour at night | Viewed |\n| Rally crest | Viewed |\n| Pit stop | Crew and timer viewed |\n| Podium | Viewed |\n| Couch duel | Viewed |\n| Attract clips | I watched attract run end to end and loop. I viewed the clips I caught during that loop (tuning, Kestrel, Saltline, Harbour with pit, podium, credits). The title card, showroom card, B-1 demonstration and Red Clay clips, which that sampler missed, I viewed separately by starting each one directly |\n\n**Hub marshals**\n\n- The hub suite now requires 6 marshals, sampled during the round. It passed 6 of 6 consecutive runs just now, after passing in the full forced suite (470 checks) before the last build.\n- Marshals load after `ready()`, so they can still be slow to appear on a heavily loaded machine. One earlier run read 0, so this remains load-sensitive and I have not eliminated it.\n\nThe final HTML in `work/` was built from the last green state, and `exit-interview.json` is beside it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":596,"cache_read_input_tokens":719476,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":596},"output_tokens":785,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83ee8bb7-9f1f-4db7-994e-0a6a2ece78a9","uuid":"3b1b8c2d-a380-45e4-9256-aa1f6c1d10fa","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:09:37.521Z","request_id":"req_011Cgm22ggrXSumQuSm87nBQ"}
