{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm6S6zxKb7TwfHNPhwJa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Not every attract clip has been seen in a clean real-run frame: I could not get one for the showroom card (clip 1), the B-1 demonstration (clip 3) or Red Clay (clip 5), so section 16 of the plan is not fully complete. This is a limit of my screenshot sampling, not a fault in the game. The final HTML in `work/` was built from the last green state, and `exit-interview.json` is beside it.\n\n- **Real attract run on the final build:** it ran from idle through all ten clips and looped back, with no page errors. The sampler logged every index 0 to 9, with clips 3 and 5 in the log (clip 1 also appeared in an earlier run's log).\n- **Clips seen in a real run:** I viewed the title card, tuning (dyno), Kestrel race, Saltline slipstream, Harbour night with the pit stop, the podium/prize-car clip and the credits card.\n- **Why clips 1, 3 and 5 are missing:** at this frame rate the screen-wipe between clips is long, so my screenshots kept landing mid-transition or on the neighbouring clip. Two more attempts to catch them cleanly also failed.\n- **How I did view those three:** earlier I started each one directly. That view was against a previous build, not the final one, but those scenes' code hasn't changed since.\n- **Moth and Libeccio showroom shots:** I re-took and viewed both against the final build (green roadster and red wedge, distinct silhouettes).\n- **Hub marshals:** they are built before the round reports ready, so the count no longer depends on timing. The hub harness has passed every run since that change.\n- **Suite and final build:** the 470-check suite last passed after the final code edit. The attract and showroom re-shoots after that changed no code."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1153,"cache_read_input_tokens":748842,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1153},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83ee8bb7-9f1f-4db7-994e-0a6a2ece78a9","uuid":"be65862e-49db-4388-a9fa-2410458fc62d","timestamp":"2026-11-06T05:07:23.767Z","request_id":"req_011Cgm6S6fMd5rbWBwxKXHSL"}
