{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmABp8kyQEdThQRKzVFM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the showroom card cut-off, and the forced full suite passed (508 checks, up from 470) after the last edit. I then rebuilt the HTML in `work/` from that state. It boots from `file://` with no errors, and `exit-interview.json` is beside it.\n\n- **Showroom card:** the attract brochure panel now shows the whole text (the Kite's ends \"…BRAKE BEFORE THE CORNER AND IT WILL THANK YOU.\"). I re-shot it from the real attract run and looked at the first version of the fix. Afterwards I widened the panel slightly because \"DO ALL\" touched its edge. I did not re-shoot that last widening.\n- **Guard against more cut-offs:** the data suite now fails if any car brochure, test brief or test-card text would not fit its panel. Every car and test passes.\n- **Section 16 review:** all items were viewed across earlier turns, the final three attract clips included.\n- **Wipe flag:** the clean attract frames used the test flag that skips the screen wipe between clips. The wipe itself only shows as a brief black bar while a clip loads, which I saw in earlier unflagged shots."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":685,"cache_read_input_tokens":764209,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":685},"output_tokens":381,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83ee8bb7-9f1f-4db7-994e-0a6a2ece78a9","uuid":"2fad6cd8-78b4-4456-81d0-a9cba65bb522","timestamp":"2026-11-06T05:56:32.915Z","request_id":"req_011CgmABooBBovLgd2W5pbWy"}
