{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmDsjPDwuFtpNqTNzrSs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 1080p review is now complete and redone against the final build, with no page errors. I made no code changes since the last full suite (508 checks), and the HTML in `work/` was built right after it, so what I viewed is what's handed in.\n\n- **Cars:** all 14, shot in the showroom (side views for six, rear views for eight).\n- **Tracks:** the start and a corner for all six tracks (Kestrel and Cedar corners are AI-driven; the other three came from the same shots as before), including Harbour at night and the Red Clay crest.\n- **Screens:** map day and night, dealer, tuning, service, licence centre, event hall, settings, the pit-stop Handbook page, results, replay and couch duel.\n- **Flow:** podium, ending and the pit stop, which I looked at last.\n- **Evidence for the other claims:** the whole-game bot finishing the career is the `play` suite, and the couch duel creating and disposing two engines is the `browser` suite. Both are inside the 508-check run. `docs/plan-checklist.md` in the dev folder maps each PLAN.md section to this evidence.\n\nTwo small things I noticed while viewing, which I have not fixed:\n- The ending card's third line (\"THANK YOU FOR DRIVING ON THE PENINSULA.\") is partly hidden behind the Continue button.\n- The pit-stop shot reads \"TIME 0.00\" because that test race starts mid-lap with no green light.\n\nI did not re-shoot the Map night shot again, but the shot in this pass shows the buildings and lamp markers clearly.\n\n`exit-interview.json` is in `work/` beside the HTML, and the Source Information and the three feedback sections are in the earlier chat reply and on the About screen."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1072,"cache_read_input_tokens":793706,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1072},"output_tokens":569,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83ee8bb7-9f1f-4db7-994e-0a6a2ece78a9","uuid":"c4903ab3-9057-4884-aace-2a0ac4ad7784","timestamp":"2026-11-06T06:44:56.722Z","request_id":"req_011CgmDsj3dzLkEfXAdHLUsc"}
