{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmFcDc98iMXZQfTEUNQd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The checks are run and shown below, but I can't prove \"every PLAN.md item\" beyond them, so I'm stopping here. STAGE.md says to build the game PLAN.md describes, take file names and hand-in items from TASK.md, and keep progress in `PROGRESS.md`; all three are done.\n\nPLAN.md section 18, \"Before you stop\", item by item, checked just now against the final build:\n\n| Item | Result |\n| --- | --- |\n| `node tools/test.mjs` all green, hub suite passing all three runs | Suite totals: sim 65, data 319, career 21, headless 28, play 26, browser 34, audio 5, hub 10. That is 508 passed, 0 failed |\n| Scripted playthrough finishes the career with no Dev tools | The `play` suite (26 checks) is green. Its printed run showed all eight series won, including the Grand Prix |\n| Built HTML runs from `file://`, `session.js` unmodified and first, `pixel-engine.js` unedited | `session.js` first and unmodified: true. `pixel-engine.js` identical to the freshly downloaded released kit: true |\n| Music starts at 10% on a fresh profile and in a session | Headless suite: fresh profile and hub-round reset both give 0.1 |\n| Grep for `TODO`, `FIXME`, `placeholder`, `stub`, `coming soon` | 0 matches in the game code |\n| Every menu item does something; every car, track, test and event reachable | Every top-level screen opens in the browser suite, and the bot plays through the career paths |\n| 1080p screenshots looked at | Done on the final build; shots are in `shots/fin3/` |\n| About/Credits shows real answers; exit-interview file parses; chat reply carries the same information | `exit-interview.json` parses, with keys `sourceInformation`, `testingFeedback`, `engineFeedback`, `promptFeedback`, `aiHub`; the About screen embeds it |\n| No stray servers or browsers left running | Not re-checked this turn. My test servers are stopped by their own cleanup; the earlier check found none |\n\nSome checks rely on earlier output rather than a re-run now. These include the printed attract visit log, the printed bot run and the live couch-duel run. I did not re-run any of them this turn, and no source file is newer than the HTML, so they were taken on this build.\n\nI have no further checks to run. The single HTML and `exit-interview.json` are in `work/`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1298,"cache_read_input_tokens":827343,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1298},"output_tokens":740,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83ee8bb7-9f1f-4db7-994e-0a6a2ece78a9","uuid":"95cb10d9-7964-4147-92e2-6b2ca6ab64ec","timestamp":"2026-11-06T07:07:40.920Z","request_id":"req_011CgmFcD7dF2ze216LTJaBP"}
